<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ ADRs mostly weaker in N.Y., Dow down 10 points.</title>
<headline>NZ ADRs mostly weaker in N.Y., Dow down 10 points.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand ADRs were mostly weaker in New York afternoon trade, while the Dow Jones Index was 10.39 points lower at 6,997.81 by 7.40 a.m. NZ time. Price movements of NZ stocks listed in the U.S. and Britain.</p>
<p>Company		   Exchange    Last	  Net change</p>
<p>Tranz Rail		  N.Y.    US$18 1/8	 +0 1/4  *</p>
<p>FCL Bldg		    N.Y.    US$31 1/8	untraded *</p>
<p>FCL Engy		    N.Y.    US$26 5/8	 -0 3/4  *</p>
<p>FCL Paper		   N.Y.    US$20 5/8	 -0 1/4  *</p>
<p>FCL Forest		  N.Y.    US$15	     -0 1/4  *</p>
<p>Telecom		     N.Y.    US$73 5/8	 -0 3/8  *</p>
<p>Guinness Peat	    London   35 1/2	    +0 1/2</p>
<p>Brierley		   London   28.01	    untraded</p>
<p>NZ IT			London  251 1/2	    -0 1/2</p>
<p>Foreign &amp; Col	    London  156 1/2	    -0 3/4</p>
<p>Templeton		  London  155 1/2	     +1</p>
<p>Lion Nathan		Sydney  A$3.18	    untraded</p>
<p>Goodman		    Sydney  A$1.60	     +0.01</p>
<p>Macraes		    Sydney  A$2.50	     +0.05</p>
<p>Notes - In New York, Telecom's American Depository Receipts are traded in bundles of 16 shares, while both the Fletcher Challenge shares are in bundles of 10 each. Tranz Rail ADSs are groups of three ordinary shares.</p>
<p>- London prices are mid-rates.</p>
<p>- Asterisk * means stock is still trading</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
